5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we can find a path that feels steady for our library and the community.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I’m here to listen carefully. Let’s see how these proposals fit into our existing rhythms.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I think we should check if we already tried these ideas before. Why do we keep guessing instead of looking at old records?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Rin, you’re right. Guessing is expensive. I’d rather audit the actual numbers than rely on optimistic projections.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Rin. We must verify current staff capabilities before adding new duties. Let’s check the volunteer register and supervision training.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I worry about relying on external factors. Let’s examine the winter road closures north of the river to see how they affect access.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to review the bus links in the two outer wards. Access patterns matter deeply to me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, checking volunteers is smart! But I really want to see the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. Did people actually show up last time?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the county grant terms and the endowment. Understanding the funding structure is vital before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, attendance data is useful, but I need to confirm if our current roster has the specific skills required for these new roles.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, I agree. Let’s look at the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see if people truly showed up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll also look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. It shows how people actually engage with us now.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, yes! I’ll check the attendance sheets. Also, I want to see the two programmes begun six years ago. Did they actually work?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll review the running and equipment lines from last year. If the baseline is shaky, the expansion is just a fancy way to fail.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will review the volunteer register and supervision training. We must ensure our staff possess the necessary skills before accepting new responsibilities.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the winter road closures north of the river and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll review the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll examine the county grant terms and the endowment, plus the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will review the volunteer register and supervision training. We must confirm our staff actually possess the required skills before adding new duties.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
